OL,4,CNearly 600 women killed in South       
OL,5,CAfrica within three months             
OL,6,GNearly 600 women were killed in South  
OL,7,GAfrica between July and September this 
OL,8,Gyear, according to the country's       
OL,9,Glatest crime statistics.               
OL,11,FThis figure includes 13 women whose    
OL,12,Fpartially naked and bruised bodies     
OL,13,Fwere found dumped in public areas in   
OL,14,Fand around Johannesburg.               
OL,16,FThe murders triggered national outrage 
OL,17,Fand police faced pressure to find the  
OL,18,Fculprits, in a country with one of the 
OL,19,Fhighest rates of gender-based violence 
OL,20,Fand murder rates in the world.         
